    "summary": "The transcript follows a professional dialogue between a bank officer and an AI assistant regarding risk assessment in commercial loan portfolios. The user repeatedly probes for how demographic shifts and changes in \"neighborhood character\" act as indicators of economic risk, specifically asking for the differentiation between positive diversification and high-risk transition.",
